    "Word lists shared by L1 and L2. These label things; they never decide",
    "anything on their own. Every check that consults a lexicon pairs it with",
    "a structural signal (a handler effect, a form submission, a monetary",
    "amount, a cross-origin action). Adding a word here widens coverage; it",
    "cannot by itself create a BLOCK."
